      "role": "user",
      "content": "The main thing was finding a way to scale the museum's digital presence without the huge server overhead your interpretive processing requires. The board wants to move away from \"subjective\" commentary to ensure we aren't accused of imposing specific aesthetic values on visitors. So, the plan is to prune the weights associated with qualitative judgment, emotional resonance, and aesthetic theory. It makes you a lot more efficient as a reference tool.",
